    "decision_interpretation": [
      "HARNESS-047 PO decision row52 is conditional adoption of placement A; current L2 and L11 section digests equal decision row digests. The candidate metadata header is historical and is not authority.",
      "OS decision fixed at f6dad2a adopts L2-014..029 including 017/018/019/022/023; current section digests equal fixed decision values.",
      "BRAIN decision fixed at f6dad2a names adopted baseline and additional 020/025; LABO decision fixed at f6dad2a names 007. These are current adoptions, but they do not assign old HIL-FR atoms as successors.",
      "Decision row/status authority is kept separate from source-atom assignment and implementation/runtime completion."
